# Mobile components

Mobile-only components and the mobile behaviour of the shared ones in [../components.md](../components.md). Where each is
built per platform: {{MOBILE_PLATFORM_LINKS}}.

## Mobile behaviour of shared components

| Component | On mobile |
|---|---|
| Button | Height is the touch target; pressed state (slight scale and darker fill) instead of hover. |
| Input | Right keyboard type and return key; label stays visible; error appears under the field and is announced. |
| Dialog | Short, with the primary action at the end; long content becomes a sheet or a full screen. |
| Menu | Becomes an action sheet or a platform menu. |
| Toast | Brief, above the tab bar, with undo when reversible. |

## Mobile-only components

### Tab bar (bottom navigation)
Three to five top-level places; icon plus word; the selected one differs by more than colour; badge counts are words for screen readers.

### Sheet
Bottom sheet for a focused task; grabber, drag to dismiss and a close control; detents only when content needs them.

### Swipe actions
Never the only way to do something; the same actions exist in a menu or detail screen; destructive action needs confirmation or undo.

### Pull to refresh, empty and error screens
Use the platform control; empty and error states follow [../ux.md](../ux.md).

Add the product's own mobile components here as they are decided.
